<title>USA: Novellus up on rumors of merger, settlement.</title>
<headline>Novellus up on rumors of merger, settlement.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Novellus Inc shares vaulted 10 percent in unusually heavy Nasdaq trade Thursday, lifted by market speculation of an earnings-accretive acquisition and a possible settlement of the Applied Materials Inc lawsuit, traders said.</p>
<p>&quot;There are rumors on the Street they are doing an accretive acquistion and they reached a settlement (with Applied) of the TEOS patent issue and it's going to go in their favor,&quot; said a trader who declined to be identified.</p>
<p>Applied declined to comment and a Novellus spokeswoman could not immediately comment.</p>
</text>
